<title>POLAND: MOSTOSTAL-W SEPT NET RISES TO PLN 0.3 MLN.</title>
<headline>MOSTOSTAL-W SEPT NET RISES TO PLN 0.3 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-10-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results September</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>SEPTEMBER</p>
<p> Net profit	     0.34 vs   0.26</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 0.57 vs   0.45</p>
<p> Operating profit     0.45 vs   0.44</p>
<p> Sales		    9.19 vs  10.21</p>
<p>JANUARY-SEPTEMBER</p>
<p> Net profit	     3.20 vs   1.79</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 4.84 vs   2.87</p>
<p> Operating profit     4.16 vs   2.50</p>
<p> Sales		   64.26 vs  54.66</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish construction company is</p>
<p>Mostostal Warszawa SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
